Design. How do you understand that it is that it is a wrong inheritance design? So you need to ask whether there is a relationship. Is red a GUI button? Is yellow a GUI button? So if it does not make sense, which in this case, it doesn't make sense. In that case, this is a wrong inheritance relationship. Now let's take a look at this one.

