00:27:35,635 --> 00:27:43,355
Okay. Inheritance is a class-level relationship that cannot be changed during the runtime.

122
00:27:44,211 --> 00:27:55,531
And experienced object oriental modelers choose inheritance if there is a generalization and specialization relationship.

123
00:27:55,531 --> 00:28:05,271
Okay. And if you are sure that so between the two classes, you can generalize one class in another one.

124
00:28:05,359 --> 00:28:10,259
So in that case, you should use the inheritance relationship.

125
00:28:10,420 --> 00:28:16,359
Otherwise, association, composition, aggregation relationships can be used.

