01:37:01,876 --> 01:37:26,395
features at the same time. Now, in order to do that, so we are using interfaces instead of abstract classes. In interfaces, we are defining these classes instead of abstract, we are defining as interface. And in interfaces, all the methods are abstract methods. There is no regular methods in interfaces.

599
01:37:27,667 --> 01:37:36,567
Okay, so which means that in interfaces, so we don't have method body for the methods that are in interfaces.

600
01:37:36,567 --> 01:37:46,567
And since all the methods are abstract methods, we don't use the abstract keyword in interfaces.

601
01:37:47,347 --> 01:37:55,688
Okay. In interface, we use the interface keyword in the class description instead of abstract.

602
01:37:57,367 --> 01:38:07,847
