01:40:43,327 --> 01:40:48,467
First of all, a class should code the bodies of all methods implemented interfaces.

629
01:40:48,467 --> 01:41:02,387
As I said, so, and the regular class in the child class must implement all the methods of the superclass.

630
01:41:04,180 --> 01:41:08,980
And so, as I said, regular member fields cannot be defined in interfaces.

631
01:41:09,620 --> 01:41:14,360
So here in interface, I cannot have regular member fields.

632
01:41:14,360 --> 01:41:20,600
The only type of member field that I can have is public final static member fields.

633
01:41:23,220 --> 01:41:26,720
And in interfaces, I can only have public methods.

634
01:41:26,880 --> 01:41:30,240
So there is no protected, there is no private methods.

635
01:41:30,240 --> 01:41:33,260
I can only have public methods in interfaces.

636
01:41:34,680 --> 01:41:39,800
And interfaces cannot have regular methods and interfaces cannot have constructors.

637
01:41:40,640 --> 01:41:48,800
Obviously, I cannot have an object of interfaces, just like I cannot have an object of abstract class.

